scn 1
# Legion ~100 round 6 (2026-10-21, task-l6-gateB): a second gatehouse, to check that the back-to-front ring fill
# (ringDeep, ringDeepClaim, spotRoute) is not tuned to attackring-gatehouse-40. The target stands in a yard (1-cell
# walls, 7-8 cells out) open on the north through a 3-cell gap; round it runs a 4-cell corridor inside an outer wall
# (11-13 cells out) with two 4-cell gates, one on the west and one on the south-east. 48 2x2 attackers (range 160)
# come from the south-west, between the gates. A 4-cell corridor passes a 2x2 body beside one standing off the yard
# wall, but not beside one flush to it (a 2x2 body flush to a 1-cell wall sees the target through it). The in-sight
# ground is the yard and the north corridor seen through the gap, and the flush origins. The ring is deep (ringDeep)
# at gate offsets 4, 5 and -2 .. -5.
name attackring-gatehouse2-48
ticks 3000
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
wanderers off
map flat 200 160
# the yard, open on the north (x 99..101)
wall 93 73 6 1
wall 102 73 7 1
wall 93 88 16 1
wall 93 74 1 14
wall 108 74 1 14
# the outer wall: west gate (z 79..82), south-east gate (x 104..107)
wall 88 68 26 1
wall 88 93 16 1
wall 108 93 6 1
wall 113 69 1 24
wall 88 69 1 10
wall 88 83 1 10
type a mover 2 2500 10 1.8 gun=160,1,1.0
type tgt mover 2 2500 10 1.8 hp=30000
group A 0 a 48 rect 30 110 60 140 pitch=3 weapons=on
group T 1 tgt 1 cells 100,80 weapons=off
reach ring A T marks=1200,2400
at 1 attack A @T
